style.description:
One or more `selector { property: value; ... }` rules.
SELECTORS — comma-group them to style a mixed selection at once (`#box, #p0 { ... }`). Descendant selectors work as in CSS: `#vpc text` is every text inside that container at any depth, `#vpc > container` only its direct children, `container icon` every icon in any container, and `*` matches any type. An attached label counts as inside its host, so `#server text` is that icon's caption and `#p0 text` a connector's label.
CONTAINER props: fill-colour, border-colour (both also take `none`/`transparent`), border-width, border-style (solid|dashed), repeat-distance, corner-radius, mode (open|group), margin-general (or margin-top/right/bottom/left), drop-shadow, shadow-colour, shadow-offset-x, shadow-offset-y, shadow-std-deviation, shadow-opacity, connector-factory.
TEXT props: text-colour, font-size, font-weight, font-family (a Google font), letter-spacing, wrap-width, text-alignment (start|middle|end), margin-general.
ICON props: icon-colour (a hex, or `natural`), margin-general, label-factory, connector-factory.
PATH props: path-colour, path-width, line-style (solid|dashed), line-repeat-distance, path-corner-radius, clearance, path-margin (controls how closely paths bundle), marker-start, marker-end and marker-start-*/marker-end-* longhands.
CANVAS props: canvas-fill-colour, canvas-pattern-type (none|dots|grid), canvas-pattern-size, canvas-pattern-colour.
SHORTHANDS & ALIASES: `stroke`/`stroke-width` resolve per element type (border-* on containers, path-* on paths). `drop-shadow: <offset-x> <offset-y> <blur> <colour> [opacity]` (or `none`/`on`). `marker-end: <style> [width] [length] [gap]` (or `none`); marker styles are triangle, dart, square-chevron, round-chevron, clipped-chevron, flat-chevron, chamfer, square-cap, round-cap, circle, ring. Old short file leaves remain load-compatible, and CSS spellings land where they mean something (`fill`, `bold`, `normal`, `left`, `center`, `right`, `rebeccapurple`, `transparent`).
EXAMPLES:
  #box { fill-colour: #eef2ff; border-colour: #6366f1 }
  path { path-colour: #64748b; path-width: 2; marker-end: triangle 12 16 2 }
  #box, #p0 { stroke: #e11; stroke-width: 3 }
  #vpc text { text-colour: #111827; font-size: 12 }
  container { drop-shadow: 2 2 4 #000000 0.25 }
  #title { align: center; font-weight: bold }
  canvas { fill-colour: #ffffff; pattern-type: none }
